  "narrative": {
    "text": "The cover of the WHO SMART Guidelines publication \"Digital Adaptation Kit for Antenatal Care: operational requirements for implementing WHO recommendations in digital systems,\" carrying the \"SMART GUIDELINES\" banner and the WHO and HRP (\"research for impact\") logos. It is one of three example DAK covers shown where the handbook discusses DAKs as a desk-review resource and reviews what DAKs contain.",
